02:36:30.190 --> 02:36:36.440
And in doing so, there by
prophecy the fortunes of kings.

02:36:36.440 --> 02:36:41.030
And so it came to pass that
it would take a modern day

02:36:41.030 --> 02:36:47.330
baru, Bob Laughlin, to decipher
the nature of the intricacies

02:36:47.330 --> 02:36:51.650
